2:T845,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How much can I save by fitting a kitchen myself?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"As a rough guide, DIY cabinet assembly, decorating and simple finishing work might save several hundred to a few thousand pounds. The saving depends on the kitchen size, your skill, tools and whether professional work is still needed for services and worktops. Every project differs, so get a free quote for accurate pricing."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I install my own kitchen cabinets?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"You can assemble and sometimes install cabinets yourself if you are confident with measuring, levelling and fixing. Professional fitting can be useful for uneven rooms, complex layouts, integrated appliances, heavy worktops or cabinets requiring accurate scribing."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What kitchen renovation work must not be DIY?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Gas work should be completed by a Gas Safe registered engineer. Electrical alterations, significant plumbing changes and structural work should be planned carefully and may require competent professionals, building regulations compliance or other approvals depending on the work."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is it cheaper to renovate a kitchen or replace it?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A refresh may cost less if the cabinets, layout and services are in good condition. Replacing doors, handles, worktops, flooring or paint can cost less than a full refit, while a new kitchen may be more suitable when units are damaged or the layout no longer works."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Should I use a professional for a DIY kitchen renovation in the UK?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A hybrid approach can be practical: complete decorating and simple finishing tasks yourself, then use appropriate professionals for gas work and, where needed, electrical, plumbing, structural, cabinet and worktop work. Get a detailed quote so the responsibilities and costs are clear."}}]}7:["slug","kitchen-renovation-cost-diy","d"]
